  "notes": [
    "PROT includes only direct ANSUR II dimensions that currently have a canonical MEAS implementation or an explicit protocol-geometry approximation.",
    "v0.8.19.7 shares strict body-region geometry between MEAS and PROT. Biceps/Forearm Flexed use the prescribed arm/elbow pose and region, but max-effort soft-tissue contraction is not modeled and therefore remains approximate.",
    "Sammy-only derived/internal dimensions are excluded from the 24-target PROT set.",
    "v0.8.20.1 audit-locked correction: Trapezius aliases lateral neck; Buttock lateral markers are exact Buttock-Circumference/Hip-Breadth endpoints; Shoulder Length uses bidirectional 90-degree Harness projection. Waist Back Length retains the ANSUR surface-distance numeric target while PROT shows a straight Cervicale-height guide."
  ]
}